            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SHOUT",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Zombies are CHARGING towards our Sapflings!",
                            "zh": "僵尸正在全速冲向我们的树脂投手！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Worry not, User Dave. We have 2 solution for this: ",
                            "zh": "别担心，用户戴夫。我们有2种解决方案："
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "EXCITED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "1. Slow those zombies down by applying multiple kinds of debuffs",
                            "zh": "1. 使用多种减速手段使僵尸寸步难行"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "EXCITED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "2. Apply heavy firepower and kill the zombies before they could reach our Sapflings",
                            "zh": "2. 使用重火力压制，在僵尸撞到树脂投手前将其击杀"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "PLAYFUL",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Why don't we do both at the same time?",
                            "zh": "要不咱们两招一起上呗？"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
